{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39703","headline":"酬俞钧 · 黄滔","name":"酬俞钧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡书一忝荐延恩，二纪三朝泣省门。\n虽忝立名经圣鉴，敢期兴咏叠嘉言。\n莫论蟾月无梯接，大底龙津有浪翻。\n今日朝廷推草泽，伫君承诏出云根。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}